  "aliases": [
    "JHB1 Johor"
  ],
  "summary": "JHB1 is AirTrunk's first hyperscale data center campus in Malaysia, located in Johor Bahru on more than 10 hectares. It opened in July 2024 with initial phases of over 50 MW for large technology customers, and the following month AirTrunk began a 100 MW expansion to take the campus past 150 MW, with remaining phases due over about 18 months. AirTrunk said in April 2026 that JHB1 and its sister campus JHB2 were almost fully contracted. Renewable supply includes a solar-ready roof and a 30 MW virtual power purchase agreement with ib vogt.",
